//
//  PURPOSE
//    ai-trio 3-way Phase B coherence measurement — DEFERRED stub.
//    Phase B (3-way moderated coherence) 미구현; 본 stub 은 honest C3 emit
//    (own 22) + DEFERRED_PHASE_B 명시.
//
//  STATUS
//    DEFERRED — chat/trio/trio.hexa Phase A SKELETON 단계, Phase B 미구현.
//    실 측정은 Phase B 구현 별도 step.
//
//  CONTRACT
//    fn trio_3way(model_a, model_b, model_c, prompt) -> string
//      → "DEFERRED_PHASE_B" (skeleton/stub)
//
//  COMPLIANCE
//    own 16 — model load 절대 금지 (stub only)
//    own 22 — honest emit (DEFERRED 명시; fabrication 금지)
//    own 34 mandate-1 — wrapping 0
//    own 41 axis-N+1 — axis-5 verifier registry entry 3
//
//  CROSS-REFERENCE
//    chat/verifiers/_registry.hexa#trio_3way    registry SSOT
//    chat/trio/trio.hexa                         Phase A SKELETON (별도 step)
